         "text": "Substitute \\( u = -x^{3} \\), raising the whole of \\( -x^{3} \\) to each power: the series begins \\( 1 - x^{3} + \\frac{1}{2}x^{6} - \\frac{1}{6}x^{9} + \\cdots \\).",
